detailed:
GLM 5.3 model deployed on 56 Nvidia B200 GPUs serving about 2,000 engineers;
the weighted average price is approximately $0.30 per million tokens;
The time spent writing code directly improved by approximately 60%, and the lead time (the time from the formation of requirements to the release of a feature to the user) was reduced by 70%.

